    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485220/extras/f4d383ed9b3edc012ff12b9623819dbf.avif?t=1754396650\" width=728 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to YokaiKon, a brand-new Japanese pop culture convention offering the best programming in anime, video games, cosplay, and (of course) murder! After the death of a beautiful J-pop idol singer in a historic high rise hotel, Cleo the clue-sniffing dog and Detective Guy step into the strange underbelly of Japanese animation fandom. Could her killer be an obsessive stalker, a bitter rival, or a malignant spirit from ancient Japanese legend? Help our detective duo illuminate this dark and kowai mystery before the rising sun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a spooky 1920s hotel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interview eccentric suspects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover crucial clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware the curse of the Oni Statue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unmask a killer mastermind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by The Kindaichi Casefiles\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485220/extras/297e39571b2cf0bd3386d7248bbfdc77.poster.avif?t=1754396650\" width=800 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485220/extras/297e39571b2cf0bd3386d7248bbfdc77.webm?t=1754396650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485220/extras/297e39571b2cf0bd3386d7248bbfdc77.mp4?t=1754396650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485220/extras/f4d383ed9b3edc012ff12b9623819dbf.avif?t=1754396650\" width=728 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to YokaiKon, a brand-new Japanese pop culture convention offering the best programming in anime, video games, cosplay, and (of course) murder! After the death of a beautiful J-pop idol singer in a historic high rise hotel, Cleo the clue-sniffing dog and Detective Guy step into the strange underbelly of Japanese animation fandom. Could her killer be an obsessive stalker, a bitter rival, or a malignant spirit from ancient Japanese legend? Help our detective duo illuminate this dark and kowai mystery before the rising sun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a spooky 1920s hotel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interview eccentric suspects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover crucial clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware the curse of the Oni Statue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unmask a killer mastermind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by The Kindaichi Casefiles\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485220/extras/297e39571b2cf0bd3386d7248bbfdc77.poster.avif?t=1754396650\" width=800 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485220/extras/297e39571b2cf0bd3386d7248bbfdc77.webm?t=1754396650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485220/extras/297e39571b2cf0bd3386d7248bbfdc77.mp4?t=1754396650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
